    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d634-a3">

                <pb facs="1210" n="1172" xml:id="pg1172"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Attachment 3]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">List of Proposed Topics for American-British
                        Discussion</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1951-08-10">August 10, 1951</date>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. European Problems and the United Kingdom attitude toward European
                    integration.</p>
                <p>2. Alignment of US–UK policies in Middle East: <list>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</label>
                        <item>Egypt</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</label>
                        <item>Iran</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>.</label>
                        <item>Kashmir</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>3. Alignment of US–UK policies in the Far East: <list>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">a</hi>.</label>
                        <item>Korea—next steps (with or without armistice)</item>
                        <label>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">b</hi>.</label>
                        <item>China, including representation in the United Nations.</item>
                    </list>
                </p>
                <p>4. East-West trade.</p>
                <p>5. Economic questions.</p>
            </div>
